@startuml
title UML State Chart Diagram

[*] --> CreateUser : [Create Account]
[*] --> Login : [Login]

state CreateUser
CreateUser : entry / start registration
CreateUser : do / verify details
CreateUser : exit / account created or failed

state Login
Login : entry / enter credentials
Login : do / validate user
Login : exit / logged in or invalid

CreateUser --> [*] : [Registration Failed]
CreateUser --> Login : [Successful Registration]

Login --> CheckLocation : [Valid Login]
Login --> [*] : [Invalid Login]

state CheckLocation
CheckLocation : entry / enter location
CheckLocation : do / validate location
CheckLocation : exit / location status

CheckLocation --> ChooseWeatherInfo : [Valid Location]
CheckLocation --> [*] : [Invalid Location]

state ChooseWeatherInfo
ChooseWeatherInfo : entry / select weather info type
ChooseWeatherInfo : do / retrieve selected data
ChooseWeatherInfo : exit / data retrieved

ChooseWeatherInfo --> ShowWeatherInfo : [Selected Data]

state ShowWeatherInfo
ShowWeatherInfo : entry / display data
ShowWeatherInfo : do / allow actions
ShowWeatherInfo : exit / action taken

state ViewAdditionalDetails <<choice>>
ShowWeatherInfo --> ViewAdditionalDetails : [View Additional Details]
ShowWeatherInfo --> Logout : [Logout]

state "View Additional Details" as ViewAdditionalDetails
ViewAdditionalDetails : entry / display additional options
ViewAdditionalDetails : do / show selected details
ViewAdditionalDetails : exit / back to main

ViewAdditionalDetails --> ShowWeatherInfo : [Back]
ViewAdditionalDetails --> Logout : [Logout]

state Logout
Logout : entry / initiate logout
Logout : do / terminate session
Logout : exit / logged out

Logout --> [*] : [Session Ended]

@enduml
